<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Portman Mining makes small H1 profit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Portman Mining makes small H1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>		  (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating loss		    1.64 vs 3.17 loss</p>
<p>    Net profit			  0.23 vs 4.18 loss</p>
<p>    Sales				20.62 vs 13.28</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Portman Mining's main asset is the Burton coal project in Queensland, due for Novmber 1996 commissioning.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
